# Release Relay pipeline files: version 11
# Release Relay's own metadata. Validate, deploy (full and quick) and sync never deploy or delete a file that
# matches a line here; the results list the files left out as "excluded". Runs with {"selfUpdate":true} (the hub
# updating itself from the release-relay-hub branch) ignore this list.
#
# One glob per line, relative to SOURCE_PATH (force-app/main/default). * matches within a folder name, ** across
# folders, ? one character. A glob that matches a folder covers everything in it. # starts a comment.
# "only-labels:<glob>" after a labels file excludes it only when every label in it matches (a file that also
# holds your own labels is deployed as usual).
# The pipeline reads this file from its own commit (the default branch), never from a release branch.
classes/Rly*
triggers/Rly*
lwc/rly*
aura/rly*
objects/RLY_*
objects/User/fields/RLY_*
tabs/RLY_*
permissionsets/RLY_*
customPermissions/RLY_*
staticresources/RLY_*
applications/Release_Relay.app-meta.xml
namedCredentials/RLY_*
externalCredentials/RLY_*
flexipages/RLY_*
layouts/RLY_*
labels/CustomLabels.labels-meta.xml only-labels:RLY_*
